- Isolated SwiftPM build + **28/28 tests** under Swift 6 strict concurrency (Xcode 26.5) — re-confirmed against the committed files.
- `swiftlint --strict` **0 violations** (surface); `swiftformat --lint` **clean** (whole-tree 0/1014); placeholder scan **0**.

